  "oracle_notes": [
    "Four final-variation contracts at 100 split into lots one and three. Reset only the one-contract lot at 101: cash 10; the other three retain reference 100.",
    "Move two of the three unreset contracts to account B without settlement; source retains one at 100 and destination receives two at 100.",
    "At 105 close four longs: (105-101)*10=40 plus (105-100)*10*3=150. Open two shorts at 105; cover at 101: (105-101)*10*2=80. Added settlements total 280.",
    "The original fees of USD 4 and EUR 2 are attributed pro rata by units: ONE receives USD 1 and EUR 0.5, THREE receives USD 3 and EUR 1.5, without FX conversion or capitalized reference cost.",
    "The other contract uses collateral variation. Moving USD 12 from cash to margin raises collateral from 160 to 172 but neither earns profit nor resets its reference at 100."
  ],
